list for various reasons. Are we to hide our lights under a bushel, as
so many women are (wrongly) taught to do, or are we to openly and
defiantly to proclaim our views?

I opt for the latter. I'd rather make contact with like minds than
water down my views so as not of offend people who most likely are
Preterite, are simply past the impressionable age at which most
political and social views are shaped.

